# The repository stores text as LF on every platform (see .editorconfig). Without
# this a Windows checkout materialises CRLF and `gofmt -l` flags every Go file,
# which would make the documented `make check` fail on Windows while passing in CI.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.go text eol=lf
*.png binary
*.gif binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary
*.zip binary
*.gz binary
*.exe binary
